=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# firewall screen-allow-policy ---------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: The Firewall screen. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13.$
# ufw active, default allow incoming, no rule: it refuses$
# nothing.$
$
# UFW Firewall Configuration ###################################$
$
  [ ] Firewall             Partial allow policy$
$
# ufw ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Installed            Yes$
  [+] Status               Active$
  [ ] Incoming policy      Allow$
  [+] At boot              Yes$
$
# SSH ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] [::]:22              Allowed$
  [+] 0.0.0.0:22           Allowed$
$
# Rules --------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  No firewall rules configured$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Enable firewall      Let SSH through, deny the rest$
                           [ ] Lockout risk$
   2) Application Profiles Add, remove, apply$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]:$
$
$

